# CRC32 fix for WPA2-patched WIFI firmware
# Apply AFTER the OUI patches have been applied
#
# The WIFI firmware has a CRC32 at offset 0x3D320 that covers
# data[0x20:0x3D320] (skipping 32-byte header).
#
# After patching the 4 OUI bytes, the CRC must be updated.
#
# Flash address: 0x5F9630 = Partition2 (0x500000) + WIFI (0xBC310) + 0x3D320

# Original CRC (before OUI patches): 0x8A7F51A5
# New CRC (after OUI patches):       0x7C209717
0x5F9630:A5517F8A:1797207C
